@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
title AFTER MVP — Proposed / conditional — Run observation, cancellation and cleanup dimensions
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

[*] --> Queued : admitted immutable intent + durable dispatch
Queued --> Running : attributable actual launch / running evidence
Queued --> Blocked : capability / policy no longer permits admission
Running --> Succeeded : actual selected completion semantics met
Running --> Failed : evidence-supported failure
Running --> Unknown : observation / effect uncertain
Running --> CancelRequested : explicit authorized intent
CancelRequested --> StoppedConfirmed : actual process-tree stop evidence
CancelRequested --> Succeeded : completion wins race
CancelRequested --> Unknown : stop/effect unresolved
Unknown --> Succeeded : actual reconciliation
Unknown --> Failed : actual failure evidence
note right of Succeeded
 Terminal run is not output usability or cleanup completion.
 Deployment approval waits outside this run outcome dimension.
 Lease expiry does not authorize relaunch or release capacity.
end note

@enduml
